. *============================================================================
> ==
. * gaci_combined_iv.do  --  OVER-IDENTIFIED IV: combine the two instruments
. *   treatment  : ln_gaci_cwm (hub quality)
. *   instruments: tourism_int (tourism-heritage Bartik)  +  feyrer_int (air/se
> a geography)
. *   control    : ln_sea_ma (maritime channel, for the Feyrer exclusion); + ln
> pop
. *   FE         : country + year ; robust SE
. *   For each outcome, 4 specs: tourism-only | feyrer-only | BOTH (over-ID + H
> ansen J) |
. *                              BOTH on 1996-2019 (pre-COVID, stronger instrum
> ent).
. *   emits: COMB|spec|outcome|b|se|p|KP_F|HansenJ|J_p|N     (spec = tour/feyr/
> both/both19)
. *============================================================================
> ==
